      "sceneHistory": [],
      "messages": [
        {
          "messageId": "message:harness:23",
          "eventSequence": -15,
          "role": "character",
          "speakerKey": "participant.001",
          "audienceKeys": [
            "player",
            "participant.001"
          ],
          "text": "“先查公用工作区，不凭猜测指责谁。”叶岑提起台边的油灯，借灯光查看柜台台面与下方空间，没有触碰行李架上的寄存物。",
          "replyToSequence": null,
          "supersededBySequence": null
        },
        {
          "messageId": "message:harness:25",
          "eventSequence": -13,
          "role": "character",
          "speakerKey": "participant.001",
          "audienceKeys": [
            "player",
            "participant.001"
          ],
          "text": "叶岑向茶桌旁的掌柜问道：“您最后一次见到铜印是什么时候、在哪里？您是否经手过，或把它收放到别处？我想先核实这些，再判断该往哪里找。”",
          "replyToSequence": null,
          "supersededBySequence": null
        },
        {
          "messageId": "message:player:f9e2c0d3-c064-46e9-ac29-c5e0236f6d99",
          "eventSequence": -12,
          "role": "player",
          "playerConversation": "present",
          "speakerKey": "player",
          "audienceKeys": [
            "player",
            "participant.001"
          ],
          "text": "嗯，我在听。",
          "replyToSequence": null,
          "supersededBySequence": null
        },
        {
          "messageId": "message:harness:26",
          "eventSequence": -10,
          "role": "character",
          "speakerKey": "participant.001",
          "audienceKeys": [
            "player",
            "participant.001"
          ],
          "text": "“嗯，你不必参与查找。我先等掌柜回应刚才的问题。”",
          "replyToSequence": -12,
          "supersededBySequence": null
        },
        {
          "messageId": "message:harness:29",
          "eventSequence": -7,
          "role": "character",
          "speakerKey": "participant.001",
          "audienceKeys": [
            "player",
            "participant.001"
          ],
          "text": "叶岑向掌柜问道：“报出位置只是提供核对的线索，不等于铜印已经找到；经手也不等于有过错。准确时辰记不清，可以先不勉强。您拿走铜印后是怎么收放的？最后见到它的具体地点在哪里？请把记得的和不确定的分开说。”",
          "replyToSequence": -12,
          "supersededBySequence": null
        },
        {
          "messageId": "message:harness:31",
          "eventSequence": -3,
          "role": "character",
          "speakerKey": "participant.001",
          "audienceKeys": [
            "player",
            "participant.001"
          ],
          "text": "叶岑向掌柜问道：“柜台下有一个木箱。那是驿站自用的储物箱，还是旅人的寄存物？我想先弄清它是否属于当值检查的范围，不是认定铜印就在里面。”",
          "replyToSequence": null,
          "supersededBySequence": null
        },
        {
          "messageId": "message:harness:34",
          "eventSequence": 2,
          "role": "character",
          "speakerKey": "participant.001",
          "audienceKeys": [
            "player",
            "participant.001"
          ],
          "text": "“这是当值可检查的工具箱，但用途不能证明铜印就在里面。”\n叶岑借油灯照明，对柜台下的木箱做了一次正常开合检查，并仅在能够正常开启的情况下查看箱内直接可见的物品；遇到锁闭或卡阻便停止，没有强拆，没有翻动箱内物品，也没有触碰旅人的寄存物。",
          "replyToSequence": null,
          "supersededBySequence": null
        },
        {
          "messageId": "message:harness:36",
          "eventSequence": 4,
          "role": "character",
          "speakerKey": "participant.001",
          "audienceKeys": [
            "player",
            "participant.001"
          ],
          "text": "叶岑从柜台下的木箱里取出铜印，放在柜台上，向你说道：“铜印放在柜台下的木箱里，现在已经取回。找到它，不等于收放经过也查清了，不能据此指责任何住客。”",
          "replyToSequence": null,
          "supersededBySequence": null
        }
      ],
